1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,264
Tu fais quoi ce week-end ?
What are you doing this weekend?

2
00:00:03,764 --> 00:00:07,748
Je ne sais pas encore. Et toi ?
I don't know yet. And you?

3
00:00:08,248 --> 00:00:10,840
Je veux aller au cinéma.
I want to go to the cinema.

4
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:13,212
Bonne idée !
Good idea!

5
00:00:13,712 --> 00:00:16,280
Tu veux venir avec moi ?
Do you want to come with me?

6
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:19,444
Oui, avec plaisir !
Yes, I'd love to!

7
00:00:19,944 --> 00:00:22,464
On se retrouve samedi ?
Shall we meet on Saturday?

8
00:00:22,964 --> 00:00:26,540
D'accord ! À samedi !
Okay! See you Saturday!

9
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,936
À samedi !
See you Saturday!

